  "id": "list_cfev_wetlands",
  "title": "LIST CFEV Wetlands",
  "description": "LIST CFEV Wetlands: LIST product `LIST_CFEV_WETLANDS`, statewide. 20,597 features, multi-polygon (EPSG:28355). Built from the 29 per-LGA LIST zips: features LIST clipped at LGA boundaries are rejoined to one row per `WL_ID`, and an `lga` column names the source LGA(s); parts outside every LGA (over open water) are not in any LGA file. Source released 2025-07-17. Data (c) State of Tasmania, CC BY 3.0 AU: cite as \"LIST CFEV Wetlands\" from theLIST (c) State of Tasmania.",
